# Contributing

## Prerequisites

- PowerShell 6 or later
- .NET SDK
- Rust stable toolchain
- Node.js and npm
- Docker

## Build and test

Run the complete local validation pipeline from the repository root:

```powershell
pwsh ./.build/build.ps1 -Build BuildTestAndCheck -Verbose
```

The build starts and removes its own temporary PostgreSQL and application containers.

## Pull requests

Keep each pull request focused and use a Conventional Commits title.
